# Valgrind suppressions of this repository, read after the server's own src/tools/valgrind.supp (scripts/valgrind.sh).
# Every entry names the third-party or PostgreSQL frame it hides and why it is not a pg_sift defect. No entry may match a pg_sift frame:
# a finding in pg_sift is fixed at its root. The file starts empty: the first runs needed none.
